  # Grounding AI reduces hallucinations and increases response accuracy
  
  ![Iris Zarecki](https://www.k2view.com/hubfs/Iris%20headshot.jpg)
  
  ### [Iris Zarecki,](https://www.k2view.com/blog/author/iris-zarecki-product-marketing-manager) Product Marketing Director
  
